on of ovarian function (By similarity). Plays a role in renal development (PubMed:28381549)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}